{"schema_version": "exam-kp-candidate-batch-0.1", "batch_id": "MODERN-INFORMATIONAL-2016-2024", "exam_node_id": "GK-NCA-2021-Q003-TOP", "exam_id": "GK-NCA-2021", "year": 2021, "question_id": 3, "subquestion_code": "TOP", "question_type_l1": "objective_choice", "question_type_l2": "modern_reading_informational", "response_form": "objective_informational_reading", "analysis_scope": "question_segment_with_possible_related_context", "candidate_atomic_exam_point": "现代文信息筛选、概念理解、归纳与推断", "candidate_ability_action": "对照原文筛选、整合并判断信息", "candidate_basis": "题型标签、题干任务和解析候选中的信息阅读考点描述；非正式知识点", "prompt_excerpt": "3. 根据原文内容，下列说法不正确的一项是（）A. 姚名达评估二千年来目录学传统，既立足于历史，又体现出学术批判的精神。\nB. 与主题分述法相比，使用断代法来写中国目录学史，更能接近历史的本来面貌。\nC. 《中国目录学史》不墨守成规而有所创新，本文作者对该书的理论框架表示认可。\nD. 在近代西学东渐的背景下，《中国目录学史》体现出传统学术向现代学术的转型。\n", "prompt_source": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2021/segments/question/Q003.md", "prompt_source_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2021年高考语文试卷（全国甲卷）（空白卷）.pdf", "analysis_source": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2021/segments/analysis/Q003.md", "analysis_source_sha256": "cf3d7147b1205bd2ee932a45755d418010c2971d759ca15de4d8846179be9452", "answer_candidate": null, "answer_candidate_method": "objective_answer_not_auto_extracted", "answer_candidate_status": "objective_candidate_source", "analysis_contains_answer_marker": true, "upstream_answer_source_status": "candidate_unverified", "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "score_candidate": 3, "score_status": "question_level_candidate", "knowledge_evidence_excerpt": "本题考查学生理解分析原文内容的能力。 本题考查学生分析论点、论据与论证关系的能力。 本题考查学生筛选并整合信息的能力。", "ability_level_candidates": [], "subskill_candidates": ["信息筛选", "概念理解", "归纳概括", "推断验证"], "manual_review_gate": "objective_answer_and_evidence_review_required", "source_warnings": [], "ocr_status": "not_flagged_in_slice_review", "kp_id": "N/A", "mapping_level": "M0", "review_status": "candidate_only", "na_reason": "客观题答案独立核验与教材KP双向证据尚未闭合。"}
{"schema_version": "exam-kp-candidate-batch-0.1", "batch_id": "MODERN-INFORMATIONAL-2016-2024", "exam_node_id": "GK-NCA-2022-Q001-TOP", "exam_id": "GK-NCA-2022", "year": 2022, "question_id": 1, "subquestion_code": "TOP", "question_type_l1": "objective_choice", "question_type_l2": "modern_reading_informational", "response_form": "objective_informational_reading", "analysis_scope": "question_segment_with_possible_related_context", "candidate_atomic_exam_point": "现代文信息筛选、概念理解、归纳与推断", "candidate_ability_action": "结合语境理解重要概念和句子含义", "candidate_basis": "题型标签、题干任务和解析候选中的信息阅读考点描述；非正式知识点", "prompt_excerpt": "1. 下列关于原文内容的理解和分析，正确的一项是（）\nA. 考古发现的金银器实物在名目和数量上远远比不上典籍记载，而其价值和意义却在典籍记载之上。B. 考察一个时期社会的审美风尚，应先注意其时金银器皿和首饰流行的工艺设计以及对时代风尚的传V\n播。\nC. 无论哪朝哪代，金银器纹样设计都脱不开祈福与怡情两大主旨，其他工艺美术门类的纹样设计也是如此。", "prompt_source": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2022/segments/question/Q001.md", "prompt_source_pdf": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/2022年高考语文试卷（全国甲卷）（空白卷）.pdf", "analysis_source": "Data/2008-2024·（四川）语文高考真题/exam_extract/GK-NCA-2022/segments/analysis/Q001.md", "analysis_source_sha256": "5fd860e6ca6279c9b6bccd09972792257b205d7af9bd594f0938a7d87e8ce177", "answer_candidate": null, "answer_candidate_method": "objective_answer_not_auto_extracted", "answer_candidate_status": "objective_candidate_source", "analysis_contains_answer_marker": false, "upstream_answer_source_status": "candidate_unverified", "source_authority_status": "unverified_local_provided", "score_candidate": 3, "score_status": "question_level_candidate", "knowledge_evidence_excerpt": "", "ability_level_candidates": [], "subskill_candidates": ["信息筛选", "概念理解", "归纳概括", "推断验证"], "manual_review_gate": "objective_answer_and_evidence_review_required", "source_warnings": [], "ocr_status": "not_flagged_in_slice_review", "kp_id": "N/A", "mapping_level": "M0", "review_status": "candidate_only", "na_reason": "客观题答案独立核验与教材KP双向证据尚未闭合。"}
